ZENITH-ABOUT	1
title	Nebula
summary	Web browser, powered by NetSurf
description	Open web addresses and local HTML documents in a Zenith window. Use the star to save a bookmark, find a recent page from the address bar, or open Page info to check the connection.
category	apps
icon	network
change	0.1.0	First release: Nebula, Zenith's browser window around the NetSurf 3.11 engine, with Page info, find, zoom and notices for the connection limit and files it cannot show
change	0.2.0	Tabs in the sidebar with the page in the content inset; bookmarks, recent pages and a start page; link and history menus; no six-connection limit on kernel 0.0.82
change	0.2.1	Pages fit the content inset; a sidebar button hides or shows the tabs; CSS Grid, Flex, variables, calc() and media queries; JPEG images; page source view
change	0.3.0	Enable classic JavaScript for one local file or website in a tab. Pages can respond to clicks, update text and styling, and load external scripts over HTTP or verified HTTPS.
